OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old asylum stories
OL,4,Arevealed in photographs
OL,5,
OL,6,FCentury-old photographs of patients
OL,7,Ftreated in a mental asylum during the
OL,8,FVictorian and Edwardian eras are being
OL,9,Funearthed to give a rare insight into
OL,10,Fthe lives they led.
OL,12,FPaul Tobia, a former mental health
OL,13,Fnurse, is devoting his time to studying
OL,14,Fthe patient records of people treated
OL,15,Fat the hospital known, at the time, as
OL,16,FBristol Lunatic Asylum.
OL,18,FTobia already leads talks about the
OL,19,Fpatients, and the photographs are being
OL,20,Fexhibited at the Glenside Hospital
OL,21,FMuseum, based near Frenchay.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
