OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old asylum stories
OL,4,Arevealed in photographs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "From about 1890, they started
OL,7,Ftaking photographs of the patients, and
OL,8,Fthese I became particularly interested
OL,9,Fin because they were really evocative.
OL,10,FI felt they really brought the patients
OL,11,Fto life."
